email.accountExistsBody:
Hello,

Someone tried to sign up for MitraMatika with this email address, but an account already exists. No new account was created.

Sign in with Google or your password at {signInUrl}

If you forgot your password, choose a new one at {resetUrl}

If this was not you, ignore this email. Your account is safe.

email.adminNoticeBody:
Hello,

A new account with a verified email is waiting for approval:

Email: {email}
Name: {name}
School: {school}
Signed up: {time}

To approve it, add this email to ALLOWED_EMAILS in the Vercel project settings (environment variables, Production), then redeploy. The account works from its next request.

Note: the name and school above were typed by the person who signed up. Use the email address as the only basis for approval.
